### =====================================================
### FRAUD RISK SCORES
### =====================================================

### Get all Fraud Risk Scores
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/FraudRiskScores


### Get Fraud Risk Score by ID
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/FraudRiskScores(11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111)


### Create Fraud Risk Score - Low
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/FraudRiskScores
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "claim_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "riskScore": 20
}


### Create Fraud Risk Score - Medium
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/FraudRiskScores
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "claim_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "riskScore": 40
}


### Create Fraud Risk Score - High
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/FraudRiskScores
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "claim_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "riskScore": 70
}


### Create Fraud Risk Score - Critical
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/FraudRiskScores
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "claim_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "riskScore": 90
}


### Test Invalid Risk Score
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/FraudRiskScores
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "claim_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "riskScore": 120
}



### =====================================================
### INVESTIGATIONS
### =====================================================

### Get all Investigations
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Investigations


### Get Investigation by ID
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Investigations(33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)


### Create Investigation
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Investigations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "investigationNumber": "INV1001",
    "claim_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "investigator_ID": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
    "status": "Assigned"
}


### Update Investigation - In Progress
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Investigations(33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "InProgress"
}


### Update Investigation - Completed
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Investigations(33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Completed",
    "findings": "Claim documents and incident details verified successfully."
}


### Test Investigation Validation
### This should give an error because findings are missing
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Investigations(33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Completed"
}



### =====================================================
### APPROVALS
### =====================================================

### Get all Approvals
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Approvals


### Get Approval by ID
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Approvals(55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555)


### Create Approval
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Approvals
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "approvalNumber": "APP1001",
    "claim_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "approver_ID": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
    "approvalLevel": "ClaimsManager",
    "decision": "Pending",
    "comments": "Waiting for manager review."
}


### Update Approval - Approved
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Approvals(55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "decision": "Approved",
    "approver_ID": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
    "comments": "Claim approved."
}


### Update Approval - Rejected
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Approvals(55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "decision": "Rejected",
    "approver_ID": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
    "comments": "Claim rejected after review."
}


### Test Approval Validation
### This should give an error because approver_ID is missing
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/Investigation/Approvals(55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "decision": "Approved"
}